---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "中国紧急联系电话与应对指南";
const description = "中国紧急电话：110（报警）、120（急救）、119（火警）。另附大使馆联系方式、护照丢失应对步骤和紧急用语。";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        返回生活指南
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
  <header class="mb-12">
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🛡️ 中国旅行贴士</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
      中国紧急联系电话与应对指南
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">旅行中遇到意外，下面是具体的应对方法。</p>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
      <span>📅 最后更新：2026 年 6 月</span>
      <span>⏱️ 阅读时间：7 分钟</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">🎯 快速回答</h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
      <strong>三个号码关键时刻能救命：</strong> <strong class="text-red-600">110</strong>（报警）、<strong class="text-red-600">120</strong>（急救）、<strong class="text-red-600">119</strong>（火警）。均设有英语接线员。出发前保存好本国大使馆电话。
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Table of Contents -->
  <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 本文导读</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-3">
      <li><a href="#three-numbers" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📞 三个必记号码</a></li>
      <li><a href="#language-barrier" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🗣️ 不会说中文怎么办</a></li>
      <li><a href="#embassy" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏛️ 本国大使馆或领事馆</a></li>
      <li><a href="#common-emergencies" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🆘 常见紧急情况应对</a></li>
      <li><a href="#emergency-phrases" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📝 手机上存好的应急用语</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Section 1 -->
    <h2 id="three-numbers" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">📞</span> 三个必记号码
    </h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12 not-prose">
      <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
        <div class="text-6xl font-extrabold text-red-600 mb-2">110</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-3">🚔 报警</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">任何紧急情况都可以拨打——即使需要医疗帮助时也可以先打 110。他们可以转接会英语的警员。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
        <div class="text-6xl font-extrabold text-blue-600 mb-2">120</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-3">🚑 急救</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">医疗急救热线。接线员可以安排英语协助。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
        <div class="text-6xl font-extrabold text-orange-600 mb-2">119</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-orange-900 mb-3">🚒 火警</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">火灾报警。任何和火情有关的情况都打这个。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl mb-12 not-prose">
      <p class="text-yellow-900 font-semibold">💡 <strong>紧急提示：</strong>如果无法说话，可以发短信到 <strong>12110</strong>（短信报警平台）。接线员会关注无法语音通话的求助。</p>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Section 2 -->
    <h2 id="language-barrier" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">🗣️</span> 不会说中文怎么办
    </h2>

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">这是紧急情况下最大的挑战。在需要之前，先在手机上存好这句话：</p>

    <div class="bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <p class="text-2xl text-center mb-4">📱 <strong>存到手机上：</strong></p>
      <div class="bg-white text-gray-900 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-3">请帮我报警，我是外国人，需要翻译。</p>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-2"><em>(Qǐng bāng wǒ bào jǐng, wǒ shì wàiguó rén, xūyào fānyì.)</em></p>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 font-semibold">"请帮我报警。我是外国人，需要翻译。"</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Section 3 -->
    <h2 id="embassy" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">🏛️</span> 本国大使馆或领事馆
    </h2>

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">如果丢失护照、遇到法律问题或出现严重紧急情况，请联系本国驻华大使馆或领事馆。</p>

    <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
      <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
            <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">国家</th>
            <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-center">北京联系方式</th>
            <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-center">上海联系方式</th>
            <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-center">广州联系方式</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇺🇸 美国</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-8531-3000</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-8011-2200</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-3814-5000</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇬🇧 英国</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-5192-4000</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-3279-2000</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-8314-3000</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇨🇦 加拿大</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-5139-4000</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-3279-2800</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-8611-6100</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇦🇺 澳大利亚</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-5140-4111</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-2215-5200</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-3814-0111</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇩🇪 德国</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-8532-9000</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-3401-0106</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-8313-0121</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇫🇷 法国</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-8531-2000</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-6103-6300</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-2829-2000</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇯🇵 日本</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-8531-9800</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-5257-4766</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-8334-3009</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇰🇷 韩国</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-8531-0700</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-6295-5000</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-2919-2999</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">🇸🇬 新加坡</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">010-6505-9393</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">021-6278-5566</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">020-3891-2345</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-12"><em>⚠️ 大使馆联系方式可能发生变化，表中可能未列出您的国家。<strong>出发前请查阅本国驻华大使馆官网确认。</strong></em></p>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Section 4 -->
    <h2 id="common-emergencies" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">🆘</span> 常见紧急情况应对
    </h2>

    <div class="space-y-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-4">📘 护照丢失或被盗</h3>
        <ol class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
          <li><strong>1.</strong> 拨打 <strong>110</strong> 或前往最近的派出所</li>
          <li><strong>2.</strong> 获取 <strong>报警回执</strong>——去大使馆需要这个</li>
          <li><strong>3.</strong> 联系本国大使馆申请紧急旅行证件</li>
          <li><strong>4.</strong> 拿着报警回执和护照照片亲自前往大使馆</li>
          <li><strong>5.</strong> 多数大使馆可在 1-5 个工作日内签发紧急护照</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">🏥 医疗急救</h3>
        <ol class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
          <li><strong>1.</strong> 拨打 <strong>120</strong> 叫救护车，或直接去就近医院的急诊</li>
          <li><strong>2.</strong> 大型公立医院的 <strong>国际部</strong> 有会说英语的工作人员</li>
          <li><strong>3.</strong> 联系旅行保险公司——他们可以协助协调付款和找英语医生</li>
          <li><strong>4.</strong> 无法沟通时，向医院工作人员出示护照和保险卡</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-orange-900 mb-4">💰 钱包丢失/身无分文</h3>
        <ol class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
          <li><strong>1.</strong> 去最近的 <strong>派出所</strong>——他们可以帮你联系大使馆</li>
          <li><strong>2.</strong> 去任何一家 <strong>酒店</strong>——前台可以帮你联系大使馆</li>
          <li><strong>3.</strong> 用微信/支付宝——几乎到处都能用，即使钱包丢了也没关系</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-4">📡 无法上网</h3>
        <ol class="space-y-2 text-gray-800">
          <li><strong>1.</strong> 找一家 <strong>酒店大堂</strong>——任何酒店都会让你用 WiFi</li>
          <li><strong>2.</strong> <strong>星巴克或麦当劳</strong>——有免费 WiFi（向店员索取密码）</li>
          <li><strong>3.</strong> 去 <strong>中国联通、中国移动或中国电信营业厅</strong>——他们可以解决 SIM 卡问题</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

    <!-- Section 5 -->
    <h2 id="emergency-phrases" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-4xl">📝</span> 手机上存好的应急用语
    </h2>

    <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
      <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
            <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">场景</th>
            <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
            <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">拼音</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">救命！</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-red-600 font-bold text-lg">救命！</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4"><em>Jiù mìng!</em></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">报警</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-red-600 font-bold text-lg">报警</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4"><em>Bào jǐng</em></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">我需要救护车</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-blue-600 font-bold text-lg">我需要救护车</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4"><em>Wǒ xūyào jiùhù chē</em></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">我迷路了</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-orange-600 font-bold text-lg">我迷路了</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4"><em>Wǒ mílù le</em></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">我感觉不舒服</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-purple-600 font-bold text-lg">我感觉不舒服</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4"><em>Wǒ gǎnjué bù shūfu</em></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">我的护照被偷了</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-red-600 font-bold text-lg">我的护照被偷了</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4"><em>Wǒ de hùzhào bèi tōu le</em></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">最近的医院在哪里？</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-blue-600 font-bold text-lg">最近的医院在哪里？</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4"><em>Zuìjìn de yīyuàn zài nǎlǐ?</em></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">带我去这里</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-purple-600 font-bold text-lg">带我去这里</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4"><em>Dài wǒ qù zhèlǐ</em></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />
  </div>

  <!-- Related Guides -->
  <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 相关攻略</h3>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <a href="/zh/life/is-china-safe/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">去中国旅行安全吗？</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">当地人的真实回答</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/zh/life/common-scams/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">中国常见骗局与防范</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">别让骗子毁了你的旅行</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/zh/life/seeing-a-doctor/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">在中国看病指南</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">医院、保险和注意事项</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
</Layout>